---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const contactEmail = 'ohkaygamersofficialdev@gmail.com';
const lastUpdated = 'June 6, 2026';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title="Privacy Policy | Oh KAY Gamers"
			description="How Oh KAY Gamers collects, uses, and protects your information."
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main class="legal-page">

			<div class="page-header">
				<p class="eyebrow">The Boring (But Important) Bit</p>
				<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
				<p class="subtitle">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
			</div>

			<section class="legal-content">
				<p class="dropcap">
					Oh KAY Gamers (“we,” “I,” “Kay”) runs this website at ohkaygamers.co.za.
					I care about your privacy and I keep things simple: I only collect what I
					need, I never sell your details, and you can leave any time. Here's exactly
					what happens with your information.
				</p>

				<h2>What I collect</h2>
				<ul>
					<li><strong>Your email address</strong> — only if you choose to sign up for updates (for example, as a founding reader of Door to the EverThawe).</li>
					<li><strong>Basic usage data</strong> — like which pages are visited, through cookies, so I can understand what people enjoy and improve the site.</li>
				</ul>

				<h2>Why I collect it</h2>
				<p>I use your email to send you things you asked for: news about my games and stories, early access, launch dates, discounts, and the occasional behind-the-scenes peek. That's it.</p>

				<h2>The legal bit</h2>
				<p>I only email you because you gave me permission (your consent) by signing up. You can take that permission back at any moment.</p>

				<h2>Who helps me handle your data</h2>
				<p>
					I use <strong>Omnisend</strong> to store email addresses and send newsletters. When you sign up, your
					email is stored securely on their service. Omnisend acts as my data processor and has its own privacy
					policy you can read at
					<a href="https://www.omnisend.com/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">omnisend.com/privacy</a>.
					I don't share your information with anyone else, and I never sell it.
				</p>

				<h2>Cookies</h2>
				<p>This site uses cookies to remember basic preferences and to understand how the site is used. You can turn cookies off in your browser settings — the site will still work.</p>

				<h2>Your rights</h2>
				<ul>
					<li><strong>Unsubscribe</strong> — every email I send has an unsubscribe link at the bottom. One click and you're out.</li>
					<li><strong>See your data</strong> — you can ask me what information I hold about you.</li>
					<li><strong>Delete your data</strong> — you can ask me to delete it completely, and I will.</li>
				</ul>

				<h2>Keeping your data</h2>
				<p>I keep your email only for as long as you want to hear from me. Unsubscribe or ask me to delete it, and it's gone.</p>

				<h2>Children</h2>
				<p>This site and its mailing list aren't aimed at children under 16. If you're under 16, please don't sign up without a parent or guardian's permission.</p>

				<h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
				<p>If I change how I handle your data, I'll update this page and change the “last updated” date at the top.</p>

				<h2>Get in touch</h2>
				<p>Questions about your privacy, or want your data removed? Email me at <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a> and I'll sort it out.</p>
			</section>

		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.legal-page {
		max-width: 760px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 3em 1.5em 5em;
	}

	.page-header {
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: 3em;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		font-family: 'Cinzel', Georgia, serif;
		font-size: 0.78em;
		letter-spacing: 0.22em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--accent);
		margin: 0 0 0.8em;
	}

	.page-header h1 {
		font-size: 3em;
		margin: 0 0 0.3em;
		text-shadow: 0 0 50px rgba(139, 0, 0, 0.25);
	}

	.subtitle {
		color: var(--gray-text);
		font-style: italic;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.legal-content {
		line-height: 1.75;
		color: var(--white);
	}

	.legal-content h2 {
		font-family: 'Cinzel', Georgia, serif;
		font-size: 1.35em;
		color: var(--accent);
		margin: 1.8em 0 0.5em;
	}

	.legal-content p,
	.legal-content li {
		color: var(--gray-text);
	}

	.legal-content ul {
		padding-left: 1.2em;
	}

	.legal-content li {
		margin-bottom: 0.5em;
	}

	.legal-content a {
		color: var(--accent);
		text-decoration: underline;
	}

	.dropcap {
		font-size: 1.05em;
	}
</style>
